          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Main compute / WiFi radio / 5-port Ethernet switch"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Shorting Ethernet transmit outputs to ground can damage the PHY or at least prevent that port from functioning; it is not a valid unused-port termination.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "category": "footprint_mismatch",
      "components": ["C10"],
